{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">在《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中，Annie 黃婉瑩示範了一道濃郁下飯的客家經典菜——「梅菜燜腩肉」。透過自製的秘製米酒，將腩肉與梅菜的香氣提升至另一層次，絕對是拌飯的首選佳餚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">材料： 五花腩肉連皮 600克 薑 4片 乾蔥 2粒 蒜頭 2粒 梅菜乾 100克 薑蓉 1湯匙 秘製米酒 4湯匙 生粉水 適量 油 4湯匙 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">秘製米酒： 花椒 1湯匙 八角 8粒 桂皮 2片 米酒 半樽 香葉 8片 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">醬油： 片糖 1/3塊 生抽 3湯匙 老抽 半湯匙 秘製米酒 半杯 水 2杯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></li><li style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></li><li style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></li><li style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></li><li style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"10fc4cff-b681-4dc9-a54a-f1f1a2011994.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20265plg7EZNb51783916091.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"10fc4cff-b681-4dc9-a54a-f1f1a2011994.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fccd17ca-ca3e-4b3c-8437-c39d5b0afd13.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026jxTLr4l1vJ1783916095.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fccd17ca-ca3e-4b3c-8437-c39d5b0afd13.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T09:19:05.140389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}